│ • [C4 -> A3] (ESCALATED_TO_HUMAN): Disclosing the count of restricted active missions has to be weighed    │
│ against the confidentiality concern in C1. Whether to show that count is a diplomatic disclosure policy    │
│ decision.                                                                                                  │
│   Eval: The design makes a deliberate choice, a count-only line with no names or details. It also has a    │
│ fallback of removing the line if the policy owner says no. The decision belongs to a human policy owner,   │
